# SQLite runtime data — local per-machine state, never commit.
# *.db is the main database (channels, profiles, points, actions, etc.).
# *.db-shm and *.db-wal are shared-memory and write-ahead-log working files
# that SQLite creates while a connection is open; they get cleaned up on
# clean shutdown but can linger after a crash. None of these should be
# tracked in git — each user / machine generates their own.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal

# Env / secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

